<h3>2.1 先看总量：count-objects 与 du</h3>
<p>优化仓库的第一步不是动手，而是搞清楚问题有多大。先看两个最基本的命令：</p>
<div class="article-code-block" data-code-block="" data-code-raw="# 看 .git 目录整体大小
du -sh .git

# 看对象的具体构成
git count-objects -vH">
    <div class="article-code-block__header">
      <span class="article-code-block__lang">BASH</span>
      <button type="button" class="article-code-block__copy" data-code-copy="">复制</button>
    </div>
    <div class="article-code-block__body"><div class="article-code-block__table"><div class="article-code-block__row">
      <div class="article-code-block__line-no" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
      <div class="article-code-block__line-code"><span class="hljs language-bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 看 .git 目录整体大小</span></span></div>
    </div><div class="article-code-block__row">
      <div class="article-code-block__line-no" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
      <div class="article-code-block__line-code"><span class="hljs language-bash">du -sh .git</span></div>
    </div><div class="article-code-block__row">
      <div class="article-code-block__line-no" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
      <div class="article-code-block__line-code"><span class="hljs language-bash">&nbsp;</span></div>
    </div><div class="article-code-block__row">
      <div class="article-code-block__line-no" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
      <div class="article-code-block__line-code"><span class="hljs language-bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># 看对象的具体构成</span></span></div>
    </div><div class="article-code-block__row">
      <div class="article-code-block__line-no" aria-hidden="true">5</div>
      <div class="article-code-block__line-code"><span class="hljs language-bash">git count-objects -vH</span></div>
    </div></div></div>
  </div><p><code>git count-objects -vH</code> 的输出值得逐行看：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>字段</th>
<th>含义</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>count</td>
<td>松散对象数量</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>size</td>
<td>松散对象占用空间（已压缩）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>in-pack</td>
<td>打包对象数量</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>packs</td>
<td>pack 文件个数</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>size-pack</td>
<td>pack 文件总大小</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>prune-packable</td>
<td>可被清理但仍以松散形态存在的对象数</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>garbage</td>
<td>无法被 Git 识别的垃圾文件大小</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>如果 <code>count</code> 和 <code>size</code> 很大，说明仓库缺少</p>
